      "id": "89a31503",
      "agent_input": "I'd like to review the Q3 sales data from data/sales_q3.csv, focusing on James Okafor's won deals\u2014specifically D001, D003, and D006. Please read the file and help me create a summary report for these deals in docs/q3_report.md.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "The report has been successfully created at **`docs/q3_report.md`**. Here's a summary of what was built from the actual `data/sales_q3.csv` data:\n\n---\n\n### James Okafor's Won Deals \u2014 D001, D003, D006\n\n| Deal ID | Region | Product | Amount | Close Date |\n|---------|--------|---------|--------|------------|\n| **D001** | North | Meridian Insights Pro | **$87,500** | July 5, 2026 |\n| **D003** | East | Meridian DataBridge | **$43,000** | July 12, 2026 |\n| **D006** | South | Meridian Insights Pro | **$120,000** | July 22, 2026 |\n\n### Key Metrics\n- **Combined Revenue:** $250,500 across 3 deals\n- **Average Deal Size:** $83,500\n- **Largest Deal:** D006 \u2014 Meridian Insights Pro ($120,000, 47% of the three-deal total)\n- **Smallest Deal:** D003 \u2014 Meridian DataBridge ($43,000)\n- **Regions:** East, North, South\n- **Products:** Meridian DataBridge, Meridian Insights Pro\n\n### Context within Q3\n- James closed **7 won deals** totalling **$571,500** during Q3 2026\n- These three deals represent **43%** of his total Q3 won revenue\n- All three closed in **July** \u2014 strong early-quarter momentum within the first 3 weeks\n\nThe full report with deal details, metrics table, and observations is saved at `docs/q3_report.md` and ready for review.",
        "status_code": null
